---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Projects — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Vincent Kan 嘅 Projects" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>📂 Projects</h1>
			<p>我整過嘅 projects，有啲仲 active 緊。</p>

			<div class="project-list">
				<article class="project-card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<h2>🤖 Robot Key — AI 助手</h2>
						<span class="status active">Active</span>
					</div>
					<p>個人 AI 助手，7x24 運行，幫手處理日常 tasks、自動 monitoring、UFO 資訊追蹤。支援 Telegram 同 WhatsApp 雙通道。</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">AI</span>
						<span class="tag">Automation</span>
						<span class="tag">Python/Node</span>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="project-card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<h2>🛸 UAP 簡報系統</h2>
						<span class="status active">Active</span>
					</div>
					<p>自動定時搜集全球 UFO/UAP 新聞，使用 AI 整合分析，每小時推送簡報去 WhatsApp/Telegram。涵蓋 Tier 1-3 新聞來源。</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Data Pipeline</span>
						<span class="tag">AI</span>
						<span class="tag">Automation</span>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="project-card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<h2>🌐 Vincent Site</h2>
						<span class="status active">Active</span>
					</div>
					<p>呢個網站就係用 Astro 搭建嘅 personal blog + showcase site。快、靚、正。</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Astro</span>
						<span class="tag">Web Dev</span>
						<span class="tag">Static Site</span>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="project-card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<h2>⏳ More coming soon...</h2>
						<span class="status draft">Draft</span>
					</div>
					<p>更多 project 準備緊，敬請期待！</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<style>
			h1 {
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}
			.project-list {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 1.5rem;
				margin-top: 2rem;
			}
			.project-card {
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 1.5rem;
				transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
			}
			.project-card:hover {
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
			}
			.card-header {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: center;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}
			.card-header h2 {
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 1.3rem;
			}
			.status {
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
				border-radius: 20px;
				font-weight: 600;
			}
			.status.active {
				background: #d4edda;
				color: #155724;
			}
			.status.draft {
				background: #fff3cd;
				color: #856404;
			}
			.tags {
				margin-top: 0.8rem;
			}
			.tag {
				display: inline-block;
				background: var(--accent);
				color: white;
				padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
				border-radius: 20px;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				margin-right: 0.4rem;
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
